Status: final 10-27 02:30 except the effort default (Karl decides; suggested: DeepSeek effort 50). The follow-up block
finished 10-26 20:30; the hard set, the DSpark items, the repeat pairs and the 128K check ran overnight (10-26 21:26 to
10-27 02:13; every kernel check clean).

