|---|---|
| Engine | Strata v0.2.6 + the #343 port (prompt skip across the layer split) + a local slot RAM cap ("slotram"), local build `engine-v026p343-slotram-ds41` (575de3a8df3f; since 10-27 02:13, was `engine-v026p343-ds41`); IQ_Q8K and BORROW not included |
