(15:56:53-16:21:59; 25.6 min with the server start and stop). DeepSeek effort 50 (final config, daily store) - 51
answers in 57 min. Both with thinking budget 8,192 + room for the full answer; no answer cut off at effort 50.

Waiting time on the same 51 prompts (seconds per answer; "first answer" = time to the first answer token, after the
thinking; research items run several search steps and have no single first-answer time):

| Category | n | Qwen avg | Qwen worst | Qwen first answer | DeepSeek e50 avg | DeepSeek e50 worst | DeepSeek e50 first answer |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| coding | 10 | 19.4 | 38.6 | 16.4 | 104.4 | 291.9 | 89.7 |
